  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural Resource Management in Middle East and North Africa (MENA) - Revenue Watch Institute (RWI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Natural Resource Management in Middle East and North Africa (MENA) - Revenue Watch Institute (RWI) is a component of Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - Natural Resource Management in the Middle East and North Africa (MENA) Region reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;3,982,859. This project benefits Middle East, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Energy policy and administrative management, Democratic participation and civil society, Media and free flow of information, Legislatures and political parties.</narrative>
  </description>
